   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Maya. You're verified, and I've looked at order O-5101 from Pho Real.\n\n- **Late delivery:** It was promised for 6:40 PM and arrived at 7:05 PM, which is 25 minutes late. Under our policy, that earns account credit equal to the delivery fee. I've added **$3.99** to your account. You can use it on a future order.\n- **Lukewarm pho:** I'm sorry it wasn't hot. Our policy only covers refunds or credits for missing or wrong items, and for late delivery. Because of that, I can't offer anything extra for the temperature.\n\nIf something was missing or incorrect in the order, tell me and I'll look into it. Is there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks. But I paid with my Visa, and I'd really rather have the money back on my card than $3.99 in app credit. I'm not going to use Forkful again tonight anyway."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand you'd rather have the money on your Visa, Maya. Our policy only allows late-delivery compensation as account credit, so I can't refund it to your card. I also can't swap the credit I already issued for a refund. The $3.99 stays on your account, and you can use it on any future order whenever you like.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with tonight?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, I get that it's policy. I'm not thrilled, but I'll take the credit. Thanks for looking into it."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome, Maya. I'm sorry tonight's dinner didn't go as it should have. The $3.99 credit is on your account for your next order. Have a good evening."
  }
